# Build output — must never be committed. A stale tracked dist caused the
# extension build to fail on a missing @2fauth/ui StackLayout export. Builds
# are produced on demand via `pnpm run build` (prepack) and consumed through
# workspace links, so committing them only causes drift.
packages/*/dist

